OL,3,GNEWSATrial of facts over ex-mayor's
OL,4,A'bigoted' tweets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former North Yorkshire councillor who
OL,7,Falso served as the mayor of Harrogate
OL,8,Fposted antisemitic tweets which were
OL,9,F"greater than bigotry in the extreme",
OL,10,Fa court heard.
OL,12,FPat Marsh, 78, is accused of stirring
OL,13,Fup racial hatred by publishing written
OL,14,Fmaterial in relation to posts made on X
OL,15,Fin January and February 2024.
OL,17,FA trial of facts is taking place at
OL,18,FYork Crown Court as Marsh, who has
OL,19,Fdementia, has been deemed physically
OL,20,Fand mentally unfit to enter a plea and
OL,21,Fgive evidence as part of a conventional
OL,22,Ftrial.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
